    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Use what your staff's rarity allows. <strong>Ominous:</strong> Chill Touch (your spell attack) and Advantage on Intimidation (module); dim light by hand. <strong>Chattering:</strong> Reaction when a creature you can see within 30 ft makes an attack - it has Disadvantage (the module offers it). <strong>Pulverizing:</strong> once per dawn, a Humanoid you can see makes a DC 17 CON save - 10d8 Necrotic and Prone, half damage only on a success.</p>",
